    "name": "Misspell",
    "steam_appid": 3235850,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/5b112f879de3add51fba4cc8185bef9c.poster.avif?t=1755588043\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/5b112f879de3add51fba4cc8185bef9c.webm?t=1755588043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/5b112f879de3add51fba4cc8185bef9c.mp4?t=1755588043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misspell</strong> is a 2D Metroidvania, set on the remote island of Melanor \u2014 a place where ancient magic and a mysterious disaster have changed everything. After a strange mineral wiped out a whole civilization, only ruins, echoes of the past, and a strange power remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a girl whose arm is wrapped in a <strong>living magical vine</strong>. It absorbs energy from artifacts and transforms into new abilities, letting you reach new areas and fight in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/a969029dbca10e9543411f4228ddef19.poster.avif?t=1755588043\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/a969029dbca10e9543411f4228ddef19.webm?t=1755588043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/a969029dbca10e9543411f4228ddef19.mp4?t=1755588043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through hand-drawn biomes \u2014 from foggy banks to snowy mountain peaks. Discover mines, forests, temples, and ruins full of traps, secrets, and enemies hiding pieces of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/cb5d777329b4fb756cd587560a43c74a.poster.avif?t=1755588043\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/cb5d777329b4fb756cd587560a43c74a.webm?t=1755588043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/cb5d777329b4fb756cd587560a43c74a.mp4?t=1755588043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your vine evolves with you \u2014 improve skills and collect ancient artifacts that will help in fights with various creatures and exploration of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/08e5e34dcbc2b0c0777f49ed3c003960.avif?t=1755588043\" width=800 height=713 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet different characters with their own stories, and make choices that change the island and the people who live there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo in Progress:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re working hard on the first playable demo. Player feedback will help shape the final game \u2014 with more features, characters, locations, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/5b112f879de3add51fba4cc8185bef9c.poster.avif?t=1755588043\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/5b112f879de3add51fba4cc8185bef9c.webm?t=1755588043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/5b112f879de3add51fba4cc8185bef9c.mp4?t=1755588043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Misspell</strong> is a 2D Metroidvania, set on the remote island of Melanor \u2014 a place where ancient magic and a mysterious disaster have changed everything. After a strange mineral wiped out a whole civilization, only ruins, echoes of the past, and a strange power remain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a girl whose arm is wrapped in a <strong>living magical vine</strong>. It absorbs energy from artifacts and transforms into new abilities, letting you reach new areas and fight in new ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/a969029dbca10e9543411f4228ddef19.poster.avif?t=1755588043\" width=616 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/a969029dbca10e9543411f4228ddef19.webm?t=1755588043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/a969029dbca10e9543411f4228ddef19.mp4?t=1755588043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through hand-drawn biomes \u2014 from foggy banks to snowy mountain peaks. Discover mines, forests, temples, and ruins full of traps, secrets, and enemies hiding pieces of the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/cb5d777329b4fb756cd587560a43c74a.poster.avif?t=1755588043\" width=616 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/cb5d777329b4fb756cd587560a43c74a.webm?t=1755588043\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/cb5d777329b4fb756cd587560a43c74a.mp4?t=1755588043\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your vine evolves with you \u2014 improve skills and collect ancient artifacts that will help in fights with various creatures and exploration of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235850/extras/08e5e34dcbc2b0c0777f49ed3c003960.avif?t=1755588043\" width=800 height=713 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet different characters with their own stories, and make choices that change the island and the people who live there.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo in Progress:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re working hard on the first playable demo. Player feedback will help shape the final game \u2014 with more features, characters, locations, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Misspell is a 2D atmospheric Metroidvania about magic and mysteries of the past. Uncover the secrets of an island risen from the ashes of a catastrophe and master a living vine that changes the way you fight and explore. Every step tells a story \u2014 every enemy echoes the mistakes of the past.",
